WEBVTT

NOTE
TASLAK. Bu süreler bir video dosyasına bağlı değildir. Kayıt yoktur.
Yayınlanamaz. Yazı görüntünün içine gömülmez.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Hello, little explorer!
Welcome to the forest.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Today we will meet four friends.
Can you wave hello?

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Look up! I see a bird.
Bird.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Can you say, “Hello, bird”?

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Hello, bird!

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Here is a bear.
Bear.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Can you wave to the bear?

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Hello, bear!

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Look! A bunny.
Bunny.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Can you say, “Hello, bunny”?

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:43.000
Hello, bunny!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Here comes a fox.
Fox.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Let’s say, “Hello, fox!”

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:13.000
Hello, fox!

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.000
Bird.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.000
Bear.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.000
Bunny.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:41.000
Fox.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Who has wings?

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:10.000
The bird has wings!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:15.000
Who can hop?

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:25.000
The bunny can hop!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:40.000
When we see a friend, we can say, “Hello!”

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:48.000
Let’s try it together.
Hello!

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:08.000
Wave hello.
Clap two times.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:12.000
One, two!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:22.000
Now say hello to the bird, the bear, the bunny, and the fox.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:48.000
Today we met a bird, a bear, a bunny, and a fox.
We said hello to our forest friends.

00:04:48.000 --> 00:05:00.000
Goodbye for now!
